{
  "script_id": "chua-attractor",
  "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
  "voice_key": "yunxi",
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "chua-attractor",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/chua-attractor/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.66,
      "size": 58608,
      "text": "洛伦兹在一九六三年发现了混沌，但那是在计算机里跑出来的。此后二十年，混沌始终是数值模拟里的现象。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "chua-attractor",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/chua-attractor/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.64,
      "size": 58176,
      "text": "有人质疑：会不会只是计算误差累积的假象？要打消这个疑虑，得在真实的物理装置上把混沌做出来。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "chua-attractor",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/chua-attractor/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.92,
      "size": 62640,
      "text": "一九八三年蔡少棠做到了。他设计的电路只用两个电容、一个电感、一个电阻，加上一个特殊的非线性元件。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "chua-attractor",
      "section_id": "diode",
      "line_id": "dd-1",
      "filename": "diode-dd-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/chua-attractor/diode-dd-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.75,
      "size": 60048,
      "text": "这个特殊元件叫蔡氏二极管。它的伏安特性不是一条直线，而是一条折线，由三段不同斜率拼成。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "chua-attractor",
      "section_id": "diode",
      "line_id": "dd-2",
      "filename": "diode-dd-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/chua-attractor/diode-dd-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.6,
      "size": 73584,
      "text": "中间那段的斜率是负的，绝对值较大；两侧的斜率也是负的，但绝对值较小。斜率为负意味着它是有源器件，会向电路注入能量。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "chua-attractor",
      "section_id": "diode",
      "line_id": "dd-3",
      "filename": "diode-dd-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/chua-attractor/diode-dd-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.6,
      "size": 57600,
      "text": "屏幕上可以看到斜率读数：内段是负一点一四三，外段是负零点七一四。就是这个折点造就了混沌。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "chua-attractor",
      "section_id": "twoscroll",
      "line_id": "tw-1",
      "filename": "twoscroll-tw-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/chua-attractor/twoscroll-tw-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.59,
      "size": 57456,
      "text": "解出来的轨道呈现两个螺旋涡卷，中间由细丝相连。轨道在一个涡卷里绕几圈，然后突然跳到另一个。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "chua-attractor",
      "section_id": "twoscroll",
      "line_id": "tw-2",
      "filename": "twoscroll-tw-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/chua-attractor/twoscroll-tw-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.72,
      "size": 59472,
      "text": "跳转的时机毫无规律可循。给定当前状态，你无法预测它还要绕几圈才跳。这正是混沌的表现。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "chua-attractor",
      "section_id": "twoscroll",
      "line_id": "tw-3",
      "filename": "twoscroll-tw-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/chua-attractor/twoscroll-tw-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.74,
      "size": 59904,
      "text": "每个涡卷中心是一个不稳定平衡点。方程有三个平衡点：原点和两侧对称的一对，都算得出精确坐标。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "chua-attractor",
      "section_id": "divergence",
      "line_id": "dv-1",
      "filename": "divergence-dv-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/chua-attractor/divergence-dv-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.74,
      "size": 59904,
      "text": "这里有个容易搞错的地方。人们常说混沌系统是耗散的，相空间体积不断收缩。蔡氏系统不完全如此。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "chua-attractor",
      "section_id": "divergence",
      "line_id": "dv-2",
      "filename": "divergence-dv-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/chua-attractor/divergence-dv-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.68,
      "size": 58896,
      "text": "算一下散度：它等于负的阿尔法乘以一加二极管斜率，再减一。在内段这个值是正一点二三，体积在膨胀。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "chua-attractor",
      "section_id": "divergence",
      "line_id": "dv-3",
      "filename": "divergence-dv-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/chua-attractor/divergence-dv-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.91,
      "size": 78480,
      "text": "在外段散度是负五点四六，体积收缩。内段推开轨道、外段拉回来，两者交替才形成双涡卷。若处处收缩，轨道会塌成一点。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "chua-attractor",
      "section_id": "verify",
      "line_id": "vf-1",
      "filename": "verify-vf-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/chua-attractor/verify-vf-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.69,
      "size": 59040,
      "text": "怎么确认这真的是混沌，而不只是看起来乱？靠最大李雅普诺夫指数。它衡量相邻轨道分离的速度。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "chua-attractor",
      "section_id": "verify",
      "line_id": "vf-2",
      "filename": "verify-vf-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/chua-attractor/verify-vf-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.35,
      "size": 69552,
      "text": "指数为正，说明再接近的两条轨道也会指数级分开，这就是混沌。请看屏幕上的读数，经典参数下约为零点四二。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "chua-attractor",
      "section_id": "verify",
      "line_id": "vf-3",
      "filename": "verify-vf-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/chua-attractor/verify-vf-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.28,
      "size": 52416,
      "text": "把阿尔法调到十，指数变成负零点零一九，系统不再混沌。这个对照才让正值有说服力。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "chua-attractor",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/chua-attractor/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.98,
      "size": 47664,
      "text": "第一，蔡氏电路是第一个在物理硬件上确认的混沌系统，让混沌摆脱了数值假象的质疑。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "chua-attractor",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/chua-attractor/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.19,
      "size": 50976,
      "text": "第二，关键是分段线性的蔡氏二极管，它让散度在内外段变号，造成膨胀与收缩交替。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "chua-attractor",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/chua-attractor/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.88,
      "size": 62064,
      "text": "第三，判断混沌要看最大李雅普诺夫指数是否为正，而不是看画面乱不乱。感谢观看，我们下次再见。"
    }
  ],
